{"v":4,"catch":"瞬間的大意恐將致命...\n來吧，一起展開這場血鬥！","desc":"中招即死，正所謂一擊必殺──\n\n「Slice, Dice & Rice」，斬抑或被斬，將決定一切的勝負。\n\n「反彈」與「心眼」左右勝敗的關鍵。\n「反彈」對手的攻擊得以取得優勢。\n而對應對手攻擊之時，「心眼」將助上一臂之力，\n發動後短時間內，遊戲將進入慢動作。\n\n能夠充分感受8位角色故事的「Story」\n可以共享對戰或與CPU比試的「Versus」\n實現了線上戰鬥的「Network」\n進行技能練習的「Dojo」等\n搭載了多種模式。\n\n由本作的簡單操作所加深的醍醐味，與對手相互揣測奧妙，\n務必盡情享受。","publisher":"ARC SYSTEM WORKS","release":"2025-09-09","genres":["格鬥"],"players":"單機 1–2 人 · 網路 2–8 人","langs":["日文","英文","韓文","中文 (簡體)","中文 (繁體)"],"pmax":8,"poff":2,"rating":"限制級","size":"Switch 2 1.2GB / Switch 1.2GB","modes":["TV 模式","桌上模式","手提模式"],"shots":["https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/2e71af9a0001a6e169b3c5c1690e36c80e3426cf7d2f101f9f7e95aa718597a0.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/008cc90ff65539729e5bcfc386abf8b961a8d6ca97570e22aefefa599541384a.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/8cf60cb41a075cac664cc34d817d56a019a59c2d5b49f9bdd2717a846b79d426.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/b55c3b7791277e4c2e6cbdd3b14e1899e4ab90f90873c4336a0bcd3ddd3c7211.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/4fbd1406e58d0add73a1f74c2c7e0e91d319b3bd3c4f0285eec059f675ccce3d.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/565f27d8fc0aa1b72cd617154ef99d2fe597705f0444643efe4f5ffaef6ff686.jpg"],"titleId":"0100f4500aa4e000","dlc":[]}